Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0

This is a human-readable summary of the full legal text. The complete license is available at:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

You are free:
- To Share: copy, distribute and use the database.
- To Create: produce works from the database.
- To Adapt: modify, transform and build upon the database.

As long as you:
- Attribute: provide attribution to the source and license.
- Share-Alike: keep adapted databases under ODbL.
- Keep Open: if you publicly use an adapted database, offer it under ODbL.

Important:
- This summary is not a substitute for the legal license text.
- Use of this file indicates project intent. For strict legal use, refer to the official ODbL text URL above.
